# Long-term caching rules for content-addressed files (everything under /assets/ and the
# versioned fonts) are appended at build time, one exact path per file, by
# immutableAssetHeaders() in vite.config.ts. Exact paths keep a 404 for a file that is not
# in this deploy revalidating; a /assets/* rule would cache that 404 for a year too.
